{"createdAt":"2026-10-01T03:25:34.679Z","data":{"body":[{"_key":"p1","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p0","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"How to Create Automated Notifications for Free Using Functions in Notion"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h1"},{"_key":"p3","_type":"image","alt":"Image from Gyazo","asset":{"_ref":"01M3TNWSW2ARX0WMRYMVT6HHT7","_type":"reference","url":"../../media/712aa7039abfdffd62009424bdec9e0a77e889c0f6967fab8491992c92c89b8d.png"},"height":674,"link":{"href":"../../media/712aa7039abfdffd62009424bdec9e0a77e889c0f6967fab8491992c92c89b8d.png"},"width":1288},{"_key":"p6","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p4","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Notion is convenient, isn't it? I also migrated from Trello and find it very useful, but there is one thing that is "},{"_key":"p5","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"disappointing."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"p8","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p7","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"No notifications even when the time comes..."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h2"},{"_key":"pb","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p9","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"A few days after I started using it, I realized that "},{"_key":"pa","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"reminders don’t come."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"ph","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"pc","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Unlike Trello, Notion does not "},{"_key":"pd","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"automatically remind"},{"_key":"pe","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":" you when you set a time; you need to either type "},{"_key":"pf","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"/remind"},{"_key":"pg","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":" or toggle a switch when setting it up from the calendar property."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"pj","_type":"image","alt":"Image from Gyazo","asset":{"_ref":"01M3TNWPV152H3AZFMPKQH9P58","_type":"reference","url":"../../media/35e5d55f28992efc7e18dc033731e616d99166d1a0b0eed73bd62dc22958a6a0.png"},"height":1054,"link":{"href":"../../media/35e5d55f28992efc7e18dc033731e616d99166d1a0b0eed73bd62dc22958a6a0.png"},"width":534},{"_key":"pl","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"pk","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"\"Oh, it's just a toggle,\" you might be thinking!"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"pq","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"pm","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"This feature can be quite tricky"},{"_key":"pn","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"; if you forget to toggle it while jotting down notes, "},{"_key":"po","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"you won’t receive any notifications when the due date arrives."},{"_key":"pp","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":" This is incredibly inconvenient."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"pu","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"pr","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"So, I decided to "},{"_key":"ps","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"rely on external tools"},{"_key":"pt","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":" to overcome this inconvenience."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"pw","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"pv","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"the:gist"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h2"},{"_key":"p17","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"px","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"By using "},{"_key":"py","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"\""},{"_key":"p10","_type":"span","marks":["strong","pz"],"text":"the gist"},{"_key":"p11","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":",\""},{"_key":"p12","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":" you can create "},{"_key":"p13","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"automated reminders for free."},{"_key":"p14","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":" This app is a service that detects "},{"_key":"p15","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"specific events"},{"_key":"p16","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":" and sends notifications."}],"markDefs":[{"_key":"pz","_type":"link","href":"https://www.thegist.so"}],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"p19","_type":"image","alt":"Image from Gyazo","asset":{"_ref":"01M3TNWREJMZA1RCJR1Y6ZWWKV","_type":"reference","url":"../../media/063aa3212cb795aaf24806a8ce8bc4449cf84ac106827f1d99d5a3b8903d06bb.png"},"height":657,"link":{"href":"../../media/063aa3212cb795aaf24806a8ce8bc4449cf84ac106827f1d99d5a3b8903d06bb.png"},"width":1280},{"_key":"p1f","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p1a","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"\"the:gist\""},{"_key":"p1b","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"\n"},{"_key":"p1c","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Price: Freemium (only the first one is free)"},{"_key":"p1d","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"\n"},{"_key":"p1e","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Function: Detects events in Notion"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"blockquote"},{"_key":"p1h","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p1g","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Let's Set Up \"the:gist!\""}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h2"},{"_key":"p1l","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p1i","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"the:gist is a handy software, but it requires "},{"_key":"p1j","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"a little setup"},{"_key":"p1k","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":" to use as a reminder. Since I couldn’t find it on other websites, I decided to write it here."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"p1n","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p1m","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Notion Settings"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h2"},{"_key":"p1s","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p1o","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"As mentioned earlier, the gist is an app that "},{"_key":"p1p","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"responds to specific actions"},{"_key":"p1q","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":", so we need to initiate a specific action in Notion when the time comes. For this, we will use "},{"_key":"p1r","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"a calendar and a formula (Formula)."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"p20","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p1t","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"This time, we will remind "},{"_key":"p1u","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"one day before the due date"},{"_key":"p1v","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":", so we will calculate the remaining days with the "},{"_key":"p1w","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"datebetween property"},{"_key":"p1x","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":" and send a notification with "},{"_key":"p1y","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"the gist"},{"_key":"p1z","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":" when there is one day left."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"p23","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p21","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"First, "},{"_key":"p22","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"select the formula from the property."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"p25","_type":"image","alt":"Image from Gyazo","asset":{"_ref":"01M3TNWKVG25YQ1JBZVQB4SWFA","_type":"reference","url":"../../media/d8d809c109c6b44ba0451b22d7748dd02b81a527ba03f517c744046b228116db.png"},"height":834,"link":{"href":"../../media/d8d809c109c6b44ba0451b22d7748dd02b81a527ba03f517c744046b228116db.png"},"width":1200},{"_key":"p28","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p26","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Then, input the datebetween command into the created property. "},{"_key":"p27","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"In the \"date?\" part, enter the name of the calendar property you are using."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"p29","_type":"code","code":"dateBetween(prop(\"date?\"), now(), \"days\")","language":""},{"_key":"p2c","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p2a","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"This way, you can "},{"_key":"p2b","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"calculate the remaining days."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"p2f","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p2d","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Next, set it up so that when the remaining days equal one, it "},{"_key":"p2e","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"triggers an action."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"p2k","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p2g","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Just like before, add another formula property and "},{"_key":"p2h","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"copy and paste the following."},{"_key":"p2i","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":" "},{"_key":"p2j","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"In place of (remaining days), enter the name of the datebetween property you created earlier."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"p2l","_type":"code","code":"if(prop(\"Remaining Days\") < 1, \"yes\", \"no\") == \"yes\"","language":""},{"_key":"p2n","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p2m","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"This way, a check will be marked when the remaining days are one!"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"p2p","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p2o","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"Setting Up on the Gist Side"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h2"},{"_key":"p2s","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p2q","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Once you've done this, there is "},{"_key":"p2r","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"just a little more to go!"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"p2x","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p2t","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"First, link "},{"_key":"p2v","_type":"span","marks":["strong","p2u"],"text":"the gist"},{"_key":"p2w","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":" following the steps (it will do it automatically). There’s no need to explain how to do this."}],"markDefs":[{"_key":"p2u","_type":"link","href":"https://app.thegist.so/"}],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"p2z","_type":"image","alt":"Image from Gyazo","asset":{"_ref":"01M3TNWJM19136A6A15QQKRSGD","_type":"reference","url":"../../media/dde9b4d7fd79b4ef90d39b29a4e0682b138043236ef1432ccd74a6727e7d8d55.png"},"height":1050,"link":{"href":"../../media/dde9b4d7fd79b4ef90d39b29a4e0682b138043236ef1432ccd74a6727e7d8d55.png"},"width":1268},{"_key":"p3c","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p30","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"Name:"},{"_key":"p31","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":" Reminder name"},{"_key":"p32","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"\n"},{"_key":"p33","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"In:"},{"_key":"p34","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":" Database name"},{"_key":"p35","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"\n"},{"_key":"p36","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"if:"},{"_key":"p37","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":" Condition to be detected. Set the checkbox property name to be ✅"},{"_key":"p38","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"\n"},{"_key":"p39","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"then:"},{"_key":"p3a","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":" Action when detected. "},{"_key":"p3b","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"Here, we set it to notify via email when the check is marked."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"blockquote"},{"_key":"p3e","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p3d","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"If you input as above, you should receive notifications via Email. Great job!"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"p3g","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p3f","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"There’s an Even Easier Way..."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h2"},{"_key":"p3o","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p3h","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"Actually, there’s another external tool called \""},{"_key":"p3j","_type":"span","marks":["strong","p3i"],"text":"Notion Automations"},{"_key":"p3k","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"\""},{"_key":"p3l","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":" that allows "},{"_key":"p3m","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"two-way synchronization with Google Calendar."},{"_key":"p3n","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":" It’s more user-friendly than \"the gist.\" However, it’s priced at 500 yen per month, which might seem a bit too much for personal use."}],"markDefs":[{"_key":"p3i","_type":"link","href":"https://notion-automations.com/calendar/"}],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"p3q","_type":"image","alt":"Image from Gyazo","asset":{"_ref":"01M3TNWQRSSK13M5C9KYY7ZXEN","_type":"reference","url":"../../media/9acb22fed0d78dabdfdf355933d36035b72c71c73cfb55e34de5458e866db672.png"},"height":683,"link":{"href":"../../media/9acb22fed0d78dabdfdf355933d36035b72c71c73cfb55e34de5458e866db672.png"},"width":1280},{"_key":"p3w","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p3r","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"\"Notion Automations\""},{"_key":"p3s","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"\n"},{"_key":"p3t","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Price: five dollars (500 yen per month)"},{"_key":"p3u","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"\n"},{"_key":"p3v","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Function: Two-way calendar synchronization"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"blockquote"}],"description":"","emoji":"🤖","exclude_from_listing":0,"is_translated":1,"is_work_in_progress":0,"legacy_editable":{"description":"","emoji":"🤖","exclude_from_listing":false,"is_translated":true,"is_work_in_progress":false,"legacy_published_at":"2021-11-22T00:00:00.000Z","tags":["notion"],"title":"How to Create Automated Notifications for Free Using Functions in Notion"},"legacy_frontmatter":{"emoji":"🤖","isTranslated":true,"published_at":"2021-11-22T00:00:00.000Z","sourceHash":"b426b06b18e5302c663048382fb70a4a3889b278157f15987e7e353bea8e5c57","sourcePath":"ja/tech/notion-notification-function.md","tags":["notion"],"title":"How to Create Automated Notifications for Free Using Functions in Notion"},"legacy_path":"en/tech/notion-notification-function.md","legacy_published_at":"2021-11-22T00:00:00.000Z","public_path":"en/tech/notion-notification-function","tags":["notion"],"title":"How to Create Automated Notifications for Free Using Functions in Notion"},"id":"01M3TQXYJQDZY1MR4JBKBH4SR3","locale":"en","publishedAt":"2021-11-22T00:00:00.000Z","seo":{"canonical":null,"description":null,"image":null,"noIndex":false,"title":null}